# The demo path in simulator form, against the FAKE cloud (test/EXPECTED.md, "Simulator end to end").
# Run: node dist/walker.mjs simulate --script test/sim/demo-path.walk --mic-file <16 kHz mono WAV>

# 1. Boot: the walker says it's on and reaches the fake cloud. Pairing already saved configuration 1
# (vibration and speech), so there is nothing to fetch; step 3's buzz shows it is in force.
expect spoke Steady is on.
expect link online
expect heartbeat ok

# 2. Ask: Talk starts listening, a second Talk sends (a terminal can't see key release).
key t
expect talk recording
expect cue listening
expect mic open
wait 1200
key t
expect talk waiting
expect cue done
expect turn answered
expect spoke Fake cloud: this is where

# 3. Obstacle: a hand in front of the simulated ToF buzzes the simulated handle (local, no cloud).
key n
expect haptic near_obstacle
key f
wait 300

# 4. Change a setting: the fake cloud proposes short sounds; Confirm applies configuration 2.
key t
expect talk recording
expect mic open
wait 1200
key t
expect spoke Press Confirm to do it.
key c
expect config 2
expect spoke Done. Obstacle alerts now use short sounds.

# 5. The same obstacle now gives the short sound, and no buzz.
key n
expect cue obstacle
absent 1500 haptic
key f
wait 300

# 5b. Arms: the fake cloud's fixed line.
key t
expect talk recording
expect mic open
wait 1200
key t
expect spoke robot arms aren't on this walker

# 6. Offline: the fake network goes down; within two heartbeats the walker says so.
key o
expect link offline
expect spoke I'm offline right now. Your short-sound alerts still work. The obstacle sensor is simulated.
# A Talk press now gets the local line at once, and nothing records.
key t
expect spoke I'm offline right now.
absent 1000 talk recording
# Obstacle cues still work offline.
key n
expect cue obstacle
key f

# 7. Back online, and a turn works again.
key o
expect link online
expect spoke I'm back online.
key t
expect talk recording
expect mic open
wait 1200
key t
expect turn answered

# 8. The fake cloud forgets the walker: the next heartbeat gets 401.
key r
expect link unauthorized
expect spoke I need to be paired again.
key t
expect spoke I need to be paired again.
absent 1000 talk recording
key q
